supplied_form:
- name: BD Difco Yeast Carbon Base
  form: dehydrated basal medium
  supplier: BD Difco
  notes: The official current product page confirms this physical category. NBRC887
    specifies the Difco family but no historic package, catalogue number or lot.
notes: NBRC887 uses11.7g Difco Yeast Carbon Base while adding ammonium tartrate, CM-cellulose,
  guaiacol and agar separately. This owner denotes the branded basal-mixture family;
  those separately added receiving-medium ingredients are not assigned as its constituents.
  Current BD239110(100g) confirms family identity, not a historicalSKU, packaging
  size, invariant formulation or exact lot. Full constituent quantities and chemical
  closure are unestablished. It is distinct from yeast nitrogen base, yeast extract,
  individual carbon nutrients and the complete NBRC887 medium. Exact raw source label
  Difco Yeast Carbon Base is retained as occurrence provenance only, with no generic
  YCB/YNB synonym.
